{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"낙하물","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"작전 전","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"248d37f7e9d318f8f1aff4a11f12fe8b2310e4013d17b23c633b255d52a2a792","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"펭귄 로지스틱스의 또 다른 직원 '텍사스'는 엑시아에게 확실한 퇴각 경로 정보를 받아왔지만,\n리유니온의 등장은 모두를 불안에 떨게 만들었다. 이들의 리더는 미샤와 아는 사이인 것 같았다.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드가 늦는군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"……아 진짜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"잠시 후 공격 포인트에 도착한다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"쳇, 드디어 오셨나… 방금 막 포장 뜯었는데."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"짜증나게."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"서둘러! 후속 부대도 빨리 움직여라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"거기 가면 쓴 남자."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"누구냐?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 속셈이지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"한꺼번에 덤벼라. 시간 아까우니까."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야, 펭귄 로지스틱스의 텍사스가 돌아왔어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"아… 다행이에요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"새롭게 들어온 정보가 있다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"저 리유니온이라는 녀석들을 꽤 쓰러뜨렸는데 말이지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"…저들의 후속 부대는 지금보다 규모가 더 큰 모양이다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"이제 잠복은 안 하나 봐, 대놓고 떼거지로 움직이던데."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…역시 그렇군요…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온은 슬럼가를 경유해서 용문에 숨어들어온 거예요…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"게다가… 목표도 저희와 똑같고요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"그렇지 않고서야 리유니온에서 우리 로도스 아일랜드를 공격할 이유가 없어요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"용문과 리유니온만 알고 있는 무언가가 미샤에게 숨겨져 있는 거겠지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드는 그 정보가 없으니 여기선 불리한 입장이고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"상황이 매우 급박하게 돌아가는 느낌이야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"지금 알 수 없는 것들은, 나중에 그 귀여운 팀장님한테 직접 물어보자고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"…아직 할 얘기 남았나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"없으면 출발하지, 어떻게 가야 할지는 파악해뒀어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"엑시아한테 확실한 퇴각 경로 정보를 받았거든. 길 안내는 내가 할게."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"프란카 씨, 각 팀을 소집해 주세요. 우리는…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"…우선 몸을 숨길 곳부터 찾아야겠어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온이 벌써 도착한 것 같거든."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"저쪽이다! 놓치지 마라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"난 이렇게 뒤에서 덮치는 게 제일 싫더라고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"저건…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…저건…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"저 사람들… 리더를 데려왔어요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"어머……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"조심하세요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더, 녀석들이 여기에… 저 녀석이다! 틀림없어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"캐스터들은 나가라! 녀석들을 찢어버려!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"웃기지도 않는군…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"다들 조심해라! 적진에 캐스터 다수 발견. 공격 준비!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"적의 목표물은…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…미샤 씨예요!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_1_firstcontact"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"다… 당신은…"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"드디어…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"내가…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"너를… 찾아냈군."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"당신은…?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["텍사스"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["프란카"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["리스캄"]}]}
